abstract: >-
  Real, non-dry-run validation of all five OmniOmics pipelines (MAGMA, SIGMA,
  DOGMA, DEFINE, PRISM) against public datasets with a known, published
  ground truth. All five pipelines completed their real, end-to-end run and
  were checked against independent, external ground truth (certified
  mock-community compositions, reference genomes, published papers' own
  reported results, or a sequencing vendor's own classification of the same
  read file), with observed-vs-expected results, raw tool outputs, and exact
  run configurations published per pipeline. Companion package to the
  OmniOmics tool paper's Deliverable B (see
  https://github.com/oliv-angelus/OmniOmics).
